            description: "Lapins resulted from a cross between 'Van' and 'Stella' and was introduced in 1983 by the Agriculture Canada Research Station at Summerland, British Columbia. The fruit is very large, somewhat resistant to cracking, has good flavor, and ripens around June 15. The tree is very productive."
        },
